			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				6.44
			</span></i>, etc.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπὸ λιμοῦ καὶ ῥίγους</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Euthphr.</u>
					4d
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λιμῷ καὶ ῥίγει μαχόμενος</span>”
